==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-for the time being.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} [[temporarily]]; [[until]] [[later]]; until the situation changes; in an indefinite period of time.
#: {{ux|en|I think I will ignore the problem '''for the time being'''.}}

